# Allowlist, for the same reason as the consuming repo's: a denylist fails open,
# and the next large or sensitive directory someone adds ships by default.
*

!gateway/
!stub/
!pyproject.toml
!README.md

# Re-exclusions: the rules above re-admit whole trees, caches included.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
# Never. This is a per-environment credential registry.
keys.json
.env
